  "description": "With versatility at its core, the CGR is a bike full of infinite possibilities. Wherever you wish to explore, it's got your back. Whether that's a short off-road blast, an inner-city commute or the bikepacking adventure of a lifetime. In the Pro Specification, it pairs the pro-level shifting precision of Shimano's Ultegra Di2 12-speed electronic groupset with lightweight yet durable Mavic Ksyrium 30 wheels, fast-rolling 40mm Schwalbe G-One Allround tyres, and a Selle Italia Novus Boost saddle. With discreet mounts for mudguards and a pannier rack, it’s ready for all-season adventures, from long road miles to weekend escapes and everything in between.",
